description:
Text filters that can be combined at run time:

```rust
trait Filter {
    fn apply(&self, text: &str) -> String;
    fn name(&self) -> String;
}

struct Trim;                                        // trims and collapses runs of spaces to one
struct Upper;
struct Replace { from: String, to: String }         // name: "replace(from->to)"
struct MaxLen(usize);                               // cuts to that many characters, ending with "…" when cut; name "maxlen(n)"

struct Pipeline { filters: Vec<Box<dyn Filter>> }
impl Pipeline {
    fn new() -> Self
    fn add(mut self, f: Box<dyn Filter>) -> Self    // builder style: returns the pipeline
    fn run(&self, text: &str) -> String
    fn describe(&self) -> String                    // "trim > upper > maxlen(5)", or "empty"
}
impl Filter for Pipeline                            // a pipeline is itself a filter (name: "pipeline[...]")
```

Names of `Trim` and `Upper` are `trim` and `upper`.

